<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">immemorial (anachronism, book two)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;All should be well for Adora and Catra. They have successfully escaped from that netherworld between dimensionsâ€”defeated the cruel magical entity known as Chasm, and returned Angella to her family. And they are together now, back on Etheria. Safe from Chasm in a universe where peace still reigns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But regardless of how she tries, or how Catra attempts to soothe her, Adora cannot shake her unease. Images of Chasm and wounded loved ones continue to torture Adora in vivid nightmares, nightmares that cannot be treated or willed away. Nightmares that force Adora to wonder whether Chasm dealt Adora some kind of lifelong curse, back before her escape from Chasm's dreamworld.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And worst of all, even with a dimension of separation between them...Adora cannot quell the fear that Chasm might someday return. Return, and again seek She-Ra's power for herself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(as promised, the angsty sequel to &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://archiveofourown.org/works/25209532/chapters/69453045" rel="nofollow"&gt;anachronism&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>chellethewriter</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Original Villain Character</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon Compliant</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>married Adora and Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Space Adventures!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>magic!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>worldbuilding!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora and catra being cute and domestic!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>this fic will hurt you and i'm sorry</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora is kinda having a breakdown this whole fic but it's fine</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Protective Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>sleep deprivation is kinda a major theme here</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>chasm is gone ahahahah...unless?</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i'll add more tags as things progress okay</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>definitely read the first book first!!!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>includes illustrations</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Following tags contain spoilers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Possession</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>magical potions</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>He-Man | Adam</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teela (He-Man)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Marlena (He-Man)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Randor (He-Man)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sorceress of Castle Grayskull | Zoar the Falcon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora and Catra rediscover Eternia</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>im making up my OWN he-man shit yeehaw</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
